scenario: A wrong flight plan is refused
id: arch1.plan-rejected
kind: alternative
version: 1.0
status: in use
goal: An incorrect flight plan is checked and refused: the drone stays unconfigured and the operator is told why.
description: 1 - Mission orchestrator, autonomous features. One moment of the mission; what leads there is in its preconditions.
