phase Preparation

  step bad-plan: operator sends FlightPlan Incorrect
    note: A wrong plan: Load Flight Plan refuses it, Mission Configuration goes back to Unconfigured and the operator is told.
    then soi.mc is Unconfigured
    then message FlightPlan Check Failed
